The static site generated by `OKF4net.Viewer` (the `okf-render` binary)
embeds a vendored copy of marked v15.0.12

    marked
    Copyright (c) 2011-2025, Christopher Jeffrey
    https://github.com/markedjs/marked

licensed under the MIT License. The copy lives at
`src/OKF4net.Viewer/Assets/marked.min.js` with its original copyright banner
intact, and is embedded in the OKF4net.Viewer library (not published to
NuGet) and the `okf-render` binary, which write it into the pages they generate. It runs client-side, in
the browser viewing a generated page; it is not a dependency of any other
OKF4net library, nor of the `okf` binary.

The MIT permission notice (marked's LICENSE.md at that tag, verbatim, which
also carries the notice of the Markdown work marked derives from) ships beside
the copy as `src/OKF4net.Viewer/Assets/licenses/marked-LICENSE.md`, is written
with it into every generated site (`assets/licenses/`), and travels beside
the binary in every `okf-render` release archive (`licenses/`) and in what
packaging/install.sh installs (`share/doc/okf-render/licenses/`).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The static site generated by `OKF4net.Viewer` (the `okf-render` binary) also
embeds three font families, latin subset, woff2, exactly as Google Fonts
distributes them (not modified, not re-subset):

    Inter
    Copyright 2020 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)

    Inter Tight
    Copyright 2022 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter-tight)

    Space Mono
    Copyright 2016 The Space Mono Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/spacemono)

licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Each family's licence
text, with its copyright notice, ships beside the fonts as
`src/OKF4net.Viewer/Assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt`, `OFL-InterTight.txt` and
`OFL-SpaceMono.txt`, is written with them into every generated site
(`assets/fonts/`), and travels beside the binary in every `okf-render`
release archive (`licenses/`). Provenance (source URL, version, size, sha256)
is recorded in `src/OKF4net.Viewer/Assets/fonts/README.md`. The fonts are
embedded in the OKF4net.Viewer library (not published to NuGet) and the
`okf-render` binary; they are not part of any other OKF4net library, nor of
the `okf` binary.
